Chapter: DeepRecursionRt

 A browser fixes its wasm stack near one megabyte and no flag reaches it, so
 the tail rows run to one million. The non-tail row stays at a depth every
 target's default stack survives.

  down : Integer -> Integer
  down (n) = if n <= 0 then 0 else down (n - 1)

  ping : Integer -> Integer
  ping (n) = if n <= 0 then 0 else pong (n - 1)

  pong : Integer -> Integer
  pong (n) = if n <= 0 then 1 else ping (n - 1)

  sum-to : Integer -> Integer
  sum-to (n) = if n <= 0 then 0 else n + sum-to (n - 1)

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
   print-line-uni (show (down 1000000))
   print-line-uni (show (ping 1000000))
   print-line-uni (show (pong 1000000))
   print-line-uni (show (sum-to 1000))
   print-line-uni (show (sum-to 10000))
  end
